{
    "chapter_num": 2,
    "verses_count": 16,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Proclaiming Christ Crucified"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When I came to you, brethren, I did not come proclaiming to you the testimony"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Other ancient authorities read mystery (or secret)"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of God in lofty words or wisdom. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For I decided to know nothing among you except Jesus Christ and him crucified. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And I was with you in weakness and in much fear and trembling; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and my speech and my message were not in plausible words of wisdom, but in demonstration of the Spirit and of power, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that your faith might not rest in the wisdom of men but in the power of God."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The True Wisdom of God"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Yet among the mature we do impart wisdom, although it is not a wisdom of this age or of the rulers of this age, who are doomed to pass away. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But we impart a secret and hidden wisdom of God, which God decreed before the ages for our glorification. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "None of the rulers of this age understood this; for if they had, they would not have crucified the Lord of glory. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But, as it is written,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“What no eye has seen, nor ear heard,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "nor the heart of man conceived,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "what God has prepared for those who love him,”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "God has revealed to us through the Spirit. For the Spirit searches everything, even the depths of God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For what person knows a man’s thoughts except the spirit of the man which is in him? So also no one comprehends the thoughts of God except the Spirit of God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now we have received not the spirit of the world, but the Spirit which is from God, that we might understand the gifts bestowed on us by God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And we impart this in words not taught by human wisdom but taught by the Spirit, interpreting spiritual truths to those who possess the Spirit."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or interpreting spiritual truths in spiritual language; or comparing spiritual things with spiritual"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The unspiritual"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or natural"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " man does not receive the gifts of the Spirit of God, for they are folly to him, and he is not able to understand them because they are spiritually discerned. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The spiritual man judges all things, but is himself to be judged by no one. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“For who has known the mind of the Lord so as to instruct him?” But we have the mind of Christ."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}